 en from Bokaro.\nThe Moon is 20° up in the WSW · twilight.\nTimes agains
 t the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's edge: htt
 ps://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Bokaro
